    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Airbnb's founders once sold cereal at $40 a box, to stay afloat.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.07,
        "window": 3.67,
        "fill": 0.837
      },
      {
        "scene": "names",
        "text": "And not just any cereal: the boxes were Obama O's and Cap'n McCain's, made for that year's US election. So why was a website for spare rooms selling breakfast?",
        "start": 3.97,
        "seconds": 7.48,
        "window": 8.13,
        "fill": 0.92
      },
      {
        "scene": "founders",
        "text": "Airbnb rented air mattresses in strangers' homes. Brian Chesky ran it with two co-founders in San Francisco.",
        "start": 12.1,
        "seconds": 5.04,
        "window": 5.7,
        "fill": 0.884
      },
      {
        "scene": "rejected",
        "text": "The investors they wrote to turned them down, or never wrote back.",
        "start": 17.8,
        "seconds": 2.32,
        "window": 2.97,
        "fill": 0.781
      },
      {
        "scene": "sold",
        "text": "So the founders made the cereal themselves. Would anyone pay that much? They sold more than 1,000 boxes.",
        "start": 20.77,
        "seconds": 4.85,
        "window": 5.53,
        "fill": 0.877
      },
      {
        "scene": "yc",
        "text": "Then the cereal won over Y Combinator, the start-up school. It put in $20,000 for 6% of Airbnb.",
        "start": 26.3,
        "seconds": 5.23,
        "window": 5.9,
        "fill": 0.886
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "All told, the cereal brought in $30,000: more money than Y Combinator's whole first cheque.",
        "start": 32.2,
        "seconds": 4.4,
        "window": 5.07,
        "fill": 0.868
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "Cereal or air mattresses: which one would you have funded? Every Airbnb you book today goes back to the day",
        "start": 37.27,
        "seconds": 4.43,
        "window": 5.1,
        "fill": 0.869
      }
    ]
  },
